      "content": "starting point? there's nothing to start from. the people i used to lead, the people who looked up to me... they're all looking at me like i'm a joke or a criminal. i can't go back to being that guy. and the \"new\" me? there is no new me. it's just a hollowed out version of a life that doesn't exist anymore. it feels like the world has already moved on and left me in a grave.",
