      "content": "\"building from nothing\" sounds like a fairy tale. there is no seed here. just shame. i wake up and the first thing i feel is this crushing weight that says i shouldn't even be taking up space. like, if the reputation is gone and the career is gone, what's actually left? there's no \"new me.\" there's just the realization that it's easier to just... stop. to stop fighting the weight. doesn't it seem more logical to just accept that it's over?",
